<title>USA: U.S. to issue 1995 capital spending on May 6.</title>
<headline>U.S. to issue 1995 capital spending on May 6.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Commerce Department this week said it will issue a report on 1995 capital expenditures by businesses on May 6 at 1000 EDT/1400 GMT.</p>
</text>
